cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use STOA in your research or teaching, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "STOA: Classical Interlinear Studio"
abstract: >-
  STOA is an interlinear reading and scholarly typesetting tool for Ancient
  Greek, Latin, Classical Chinese and other languages. It combines AI-assisted
  token-level analysis (gloss, lemma, part of speech, morphology) with manual
  correction, dictionary lookup, and publication-quality PDF, PNG and LaTeX
  export.
authors:
  - alias: SameDestination
version: 6.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/SameDestination/stoa-classical-language-tool"
keywords:
  - interlinear
  - ancient greek
  - latin
  - classical chinese
  - morphology
  - philology
  - digital humanities
  - typesetting
